  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong asks for this grade as his condition when Ke Xin Hong offers to buy Sheng Tian true inheritance for Fang Yuan. Ke Xin Hong finds it rare in the market and must confirm with Fang Yuan before agreeing. The deal completes through treasure yellow heaven: Fang Yuan receives the full details of Sheng Tian true inheritance, and Wu Yong receives the material. Obtaining it gives Wu Yong a significant breakthrough in preparatory work for refining eight-faced prestige wind Immortal Gu. Wu Yong judges that one such lot is not important in Fang Yuan’s eyes because Fang Yuan holds many immortal materials from grotto-heavens of the two heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        2101
      ],
